      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Hokudai Kanda's bookstore counter, eager customers crowd around manager Tayama asking for the new edition titled Suzuran at fifteen thousand yen a copy. Meanwhile, in his quiet garden, Poseidon boss Ikezawa hears that Suzuran has already sold three hundred thousand copies. Just soak in the shop-counter rhythm first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
